    "done_when": "docs/research/converged-forward-solve-design.html at its new head: (1) restates the DIII-D clause set exactly as plan section 6 at 0f6da4594 (residual and every scaled row at or below 1e-6 with the value reached recorded, axis and X-point within one pitch of the EFIT reconstruction nulls, no map-fidelity clause, compile-cost and tracing clauses unchanged), adds a test id comparing nulls with the EFIT reconstruction, and binds its acceptance to the current plan revision; (2) replaces the resolution-independent membership and moment caps (5e-7, 2e-6) with budgets derived from the field representation reconstruction order on the analytic Solov-ev state, whose particular term x^2 ln x is not polynomial: state the budget as C times h to the power p per rung with p and C taken from a measured probe of the proposed representation at the five rungs, report that probe, and state separately the clip quadrature error so field reconstruction and clipping are not conflated; the review run fit-probe.log (boundary displacement per pitch 2.7e-3 median at h/R0 0.13 falling as h^2 to 1.3e-4 at 0.028 for the six-coefficient ring quadratic) is the first data point and must be reconciled; (3) names the compensating unknowns a as a differentiated argument of gs.apply or of an augmented map so the augmented JVP is unambiguous; (4) adds the 550-cell X-point offset 16.9 mm beside the 0.0153 sup in the private-flux mechanism row; and reckon audit-doc reports 0 errors",
